  realStem: {"kataoka": "", "tetsu": "Bing Fire, like the sun. Few words, but at the plate his presence lights up everyone — that's Tetsuya, the captain who brightens the whole team.", "kanemaru": "Yi Wood, like a vine. Bending but never breaking, holding on until he widens his place — that's Kanemaru's grit.", "haruichi": "Geng Metal, like raw ore. Under his shy exterior hide a firm core and a sharp bat — that's Haruichi.", "eijun": "Geng Metal, like raw ore. Getting tougher every time he crashes and breaks, with fiery loyalty — that's Sawamura himself.", "yui": "Ding Fire, like a candle. Small in size but lighting up the team with bold energy — that's Yui.", "toujou": "Ren Water, like a great river. Even when the path changes, he flows on and finds a new place — that's Tojo's flexibility.", "chris": "Ji Earth, like fertile fields. Unable to play himself, he quietly raised the seedling that was Sawamura — that's Chris.", "sanada": "Ji Earth, like fertile fields. The easygoing capacity to take whatever comes — that's Sanada on the mound.", "masuko": "Ren Water, like the sea. A big heart that calmly takes in noisy juniors and grumpy classmates alike — that's Masuko.", "kuramochi": "Ding Fire, like a candle. Under the rough exterior, a warmth that quietly lights up his juniors — that's Kuramochi.", "kawakami": "Ji Earth, like fertile fields. Quietly taking on his innings and enduring under pressure — that's Kawakami's diligence.", "isashiki": "Ji Earth, like fertile fields. Behind the shouting, a warm senior who embraces and raises his juniors — that's Isashiki.", "raichi": "Ding Fire, like a candle. A pure passion that blazes only in front of baseball — that's Raichi.", "mei": "Geng Metal, like raw ore. Overwhelming power, fearless confidence, an unbreakable ace — that's Mei.", "ryosuke": "Xin Metal, a jewel and a blade. Smiling zingers and flawless defense — that's Ryosuke exactly.", "furuya": "Ding Fire, like a candle. Quiet, yet an obsession with the ace spot that never stops burning inside — that's Furuya.", "carlos": "Xin Metal, like a nimble blade. Play that slices across the field fast and sharp — that's Carlos.", "miyuki": "Xin Metal, like a sharp blade. Game-calling that cuts precisely into a hitter's gaps, and lofty pride — that's Miyuki.", "okumura": "Bing Fire, like the sun. A catcher hiding the hottest competitive streak under a cool face — that's Okumura.", "miyauchi": "Wu Earth, like a great mountain. Even after giving up the starting mask to a junior, the third-year catcher who solidly backed the team — that's Miyauchi.", "watanabe": "Wu Earth, like wide land. Firming up the team's foundation with data from off the field — that's Watanabe.", "shirasu": "Gui Water, like drizzle. Quietly seeping in and doing his part exactly when needed — that's Shirasu's calm.", "amahisa": "Gui Water, flowing without form. A free-spirited ace who wraps hitters up with his slider behind a light smile — that's Amahisa."},
